text: ['Any player may have Browbeat deal 5 damage to them. If no one does, target player draws three cards.', "As Conspiracy enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\nCreatures you control are the chosen type. The same is true for creature spells you control and creature cards you own that aren't on the battlefield.", "As Teferi's Moat enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\nCreatures of the chosen color without flying can't attack you.", "As The Rack enters the battlefield, choose an opponent.\\nAt the beginning of the chosen player's upkeep, The Rack deals X damage to that player, where X is 3 minus the number of cards in their hand.", "As long as Gaea's Liege isn't attacking, its power and toughness are each equal to the number of Forests you control. As long as Gaea's Liege is attacking, its power and toughness are each equal to the number of Forests defending player controls.\\n{T}: Target land becomes a Forest until Gaea's Liege leaves the battlefield.", 'Assault deals 2 damage to any target.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a spore counter on Thallid.\\nRemove three spore counters from Thallid: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Krosan Cloudscraper unless you pay {G}{G}.\\nMorph {7}{G}{G} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Sacred Mesa unless you sacrifice a Pegasus.\\n{1}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Pegasus creature token with flying.', 'Black creatures get +1/+1.', 'Buyback {5} (You may pay an additional {5} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nDraw a card.', 'Choose a number. Destroy all artifacts and creatures with mana value equal to that number. Then target player reveals their hand and discards all nonland cards with mana value equal to the number.', "Choose one —\\n• Target player discards a card.\\n• Target creature gets +2/-1 until end of turn.\\n• Target creature gains swampwalk until end of turn. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", 'Counter target instant or Aura spell that targets a permanent you control.', 'Create a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.\\nFlashback {3}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Dandân can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.\\nWhen you control no Islands, sacrifice Dandân.", 'Defender\\nPut a -0/-1 counter on Wall of Roots: Add {G}. Activate only once each turn.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Disintegrate deals X damage to any target. If it's a creature, it can't be regenerated this turn, and if it would die this turn, exile it instead.", 'Domain — Tribal Flames deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'Echo {2}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Hunting Moa enters the battlefield or dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Enchant creature you control\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to any target."\\nSacrifice Fire Whip: Fire Whip deals 1 damage to any target.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, put a -1/-1 counter on that creature.", "Enchant land\\nEnchanted land has indestructible and can't be enchanted by other Auras.", "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\nWhenever Shadowmage Infiltrator deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.", 'Fiery Justice deals 5 damage divided as you choose among any number of targets. Target opponent gains 5 life.', 'Fiery Temper deals 3 damage to any target.\\nMadness {R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', 'First strike\\nAs long as Valor is in your graveyard and you control a Plains, creatures you control have first strike.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\n{1}{W}{W}: Target Knight creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flash\\nWhen Mystic Snake enters the battlefield, counter target spell.', 'Flying', 'Flying, first strike, vigilance, trample, haste, protection from black and from red', 'Flying, vigilance, haste', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Nicol Bolas unless you pay {U}{B}{R}.\\nWhenever Nicol Bolas deals damage to an opponent, that player discards their hand.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Cockatrice blocks or becomes blocked by a non-Wall creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', "Flying\\nWhenever Swamp Mosquito attacks and isn't blocked, defending player gets a poison counter. (A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game.)", 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Soul Collector this turn dies, return that card to the battlefield under your control.\\nMorph {B}{B}{B} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Flying\\nWhite spells and black spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Dragon Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn. If this ability has been activated four or more times this turn, sacrifice Dragon Whelp at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Flying\\n{U}{U}{U}: Regenerate Ghost Ship.', 'Gemstone Mine enters the battlefield with three mining counters on it.\\n{T}, Remove a mining counter from Gemstone Mine: Add one mana of any color. If there are no mining counters on Gemstone Mine, sacrifice it.', 'Hail Storm deals 2 damage to each attacking creature and 1 damage to you and each creature you control.', 'Haste\\nEcho {3}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Avalanche Riders enters the battlefield, destroy target land.', 'Haste\\nFlanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)', 'Haste\\n{R}{R}{R}: Regenerate Eron the Relentless.', 'Icatian Javelineers enters the battlefield with a javelin counter on it.\\n{T}, Remove a javelin counter from Icatian Javelineers: It deals 1 damage to any target.', 'If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Dodecapod, put it onto the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it instead of putting it into your graveyard.', "If there are ten or more creature cards total in all graveyards, this spell costs {6} less to cast.\\nFear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\n{T}: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Kicker {R} and/or {W} (You may pay an additional {R} and/or {W} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Thornscape Battlemage enters the battlefield, if it was kicked with its {R} kicker, it deals 2 damage to any target.\\nWhen Thornscape Battlemage enters the battlefield, if it was kicked with its {W} kicker, destroy target artifact.', 'Kicker {W}{W} (You may pay an additional {W}{W} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Desolation Giant enters the battlefield, destroy all other creatures you control. If it was kicked, destroy all other creatures instead.', 'Kicker {X} (You may pay an additional {X} as you cast this spell.)\\nSaproling creatures and other Treefolk creatures get +1/+1.\\nWhen Verdeloth the Ancient enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, create X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.', "Lands you control are Plains.\\nNonland permanents you control are white. The same is true for spells you control and nonland cards you own that aren't on the battlefield.\\nYou may spend white mana as though it were mana of any color. You may spend other mana only as though it were colorless mana.", "Merieke Ri Berit doesn't untap during your untap step.\\n{T}: Gain control of target creature for as long as you control Merieke Ri Berit. When Merieke Ri Berit leaves the battlefield or becomes untapped, destroy that creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Mindless Automaton enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}, Discard a card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Mindless Automaton.\\nRemove two +1/+1 counters from Mindless Automaton: Draw a card.', "Mistform Ultimus is every creature type (even if this card isn't on the battlefield).", 'Morph {1}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Willbender is turned face up, change the target of target spell or ability with a single target.', "Non-Eye creatures you control can't attack.\\nEvil Eye of Orms-by-Gore can't be blocked except by Walls.", 'Other Kobold creatures you control get +1/+0.', "Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", "Pirate Ship can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.\\n{T}: Pirate Ship deals 1 damage to any target.\\nWhen you control no Islands, sacrifice Pirate Ship.", "Play with your hand revealed.\\nIf you would draw a card, reveal the top card of your library instead. If it's a creature card, put it into your graveyard. Otherwise, draw a card.\\nWhenever a creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, return it to your hand.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Uncle Istvan by creatures.', 'Protection from black\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if Whirling Dervish dealt damage to an opponent this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Protection from black\\nThreshold — As long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard, Mystic Enforcer gets +3/+3 and has flying.', 'Protection from red\\nShadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Protection from white\\n{1}{R}: Wildfire Emissary gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Psionic Blast deals 4 damage to any target and 2 damage to you.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Sacrifice an enchantment: Auratog gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Search your library for a Dragon permanent card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)', 'Serrated Arrows enters the battlefield with three arrowhead counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if there are no arrowhead counters on Serrated Arrows, sacrifice it.\\n{T}, Remove an arrowhead counter from Serrated Arrows: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\nDauthi Slayer attacks each combat if able.', 'Spike Feeder enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: You gain 2 life.', "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)\\nWhenever a player casts a black spell, you gain 1 life.", 'Target opponent discards a card at random, then discards a card.', "Target player shuffles up to three target cards from their graveyard into their library.\\nDraw a card.\\nWhen Gaea's Blessing is put into your graveyard from your library, shuffle your graveyard into your library.", "The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to any target this turn, prevent that damage. If damage from a red source is prevented this way, Honorable Passage deals that much damage to the source's controller.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nProtection from blue", 'Trample', "Trample\\nLeviathan enters the battlefield tapped and doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice two Islands. If you do, untap Leviathan.\\nLeviathan can't attack unless you sacrifice two Islands. (This cost is paid as attackers are declared.)", "Trample\\nOrgg can't attack if defending player controls an untapped creature with power 3 or greater.\\nOrgg can't block creatures with power 3 or greater.", 'Trample\\nRampage 2 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn for each creature blocking it beyond the first.)', 'When Defiant Vanguard blocks, at end of combat, destroy it and all creatures it blocked this turn.\\n{5}, {T}: Search your library for a Rebel permanent card with mana value 4 or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "When Faceless Butcher enters the battlefield, exile another target creature.\\nWhen Faceless Butcher leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", "When Ovinomancer enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you return three basic lands you control to their owner's hand.\\n{T}, Return Ovinomancer to its owner's hand: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated. That creature's controller creates a 0/1 green Sheep creature token.", 'When Sengir Autocrat enters the battlefield, create three 0/1 black Serf creature tokens.\\nWhen Sengir Autocrat leaves the battlefield, exile all Serf tokens.', "Whenever Goblin Snowman blocks, prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by it this turn.\\n{T}: Goblin Snowman deals 1 damage to target creature it's blocking.", 'Whenever Spitting Slug blocks or becomes blocked, you may pay {1}{G}. If you do, Spitting Slug gains first strike until end of turn. Otherwise, each creature blocking or blocked by Spitting Slug gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Whenever a Sliver becomes blocked, that Sliver gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'Whenever a Sliver deals damage, its controller gains that much life.', "Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, that creature's controller may have it deal damage equal to its power to any target of their choice.", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may pay {3}. If you do, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', "You may choose not to untap Giant Oyster during your untap step.\\n{T}: For as long as Giant Oyster remains tapped, target tapped creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step, and at the beginning of each of your draw steps, put a -1/-1 counter on that creature. When Giant Oyster leaves the battlefield or becomes untapped, remove all -1/-1 counters from the creature.", 'You win the game if you control a land of each basic land type and a creature of each color.', 'Zombie spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nZombie creatures you control get +2/+1.', '{1}, Sacrifice a permanent: You gain 1 life.', '{1}: Exile target card from a graveyard.', '{2}, Discard a card at random: Stormbind deals 2 damage to any target.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Grinning Totem: Search target opponent's library for a card and exile it. Then that player shuffles. Until the beginning of your next upkeep, you may play that card. At the beginning of your next upkeep, if you haven't played it, put it into its owner's graveyard.", "{2}, {T}: Exile target creature you control.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice Safe Haven. If you do, return each card exiled with Safe Haven to the battlefield under its owner's control.", "{2}{G}, {T}, Discard two cards: All lands target player controls become 3/3 creatures until end of turn. They're still lands.", "{3}, {T}: Tap target creature you control and target creature of an opponent's choice they control. Those creatures fight each other. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", "{3}: Target creature gains islandwalk until end of turn. When War Barge leaves the battlefield this turn, destroy that creature. A creature destroyed this way can't be regenerated. (A creature with islandwalk can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", '{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{R}, {T}: Look at the top eight cards of your library. Exile four of them at random, then put the rest on top of your library in any order.', '{R}: Regenerate Uthden Troll.', "{T}, Exile Feldon's Cane: Shuffle your graveyard into your library.", "{T}, Sacrifice Tormod's Crypt: Exile target player's graveyard.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Desert deals 1 damage to target attacking creature. Activate only during the end of combat step.', '{T}: Add {G}.\\n{T}: Target 1/1 creature gets +1/+2 until end of turn.', '{T}: Destroy target creature with islandwalk.', "{T}: Draw a card and reveal it. If it isn't a land card, discard it.", '{T}: Prodigal Sorcerer deals 1 damage to any target.', '{T}: Until end of turn, target creature has base power 1 or base toughness 1.', "{T}: Witch Hunter deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\n{1}{W}{W}, {T}: Return target creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand.", "{U}, {T}: Put target creature you control on top of its owner's library.\\n{R}, {T}: Shadow Guildmage deals 1 damage to any target and 1 damage to you.", '{U}{U}, Sacrifice a Wizard: Counter target spell.\\nMorph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)']
flavor: ['"A thankless job, and a death sentence besides."\\n—Eron the Relentless', '"Catch good today. Start replacing crew tomorrow."\\n—Faysal al-Mousa, fisher captain, log', '"Command is the act of balancing on a vine and convincing others that it is firm ground."\\n—Sidar Jabari', '"Do not go there, do not go / unless you rise on wings, unless you walk on hooves."\\n—"Song to the Sun," Femeref song', '"Eron would be much less of a hassle if only he were mortal."\\n—Reyhan, Samite alchemist', '"Even the threat of power has power."\\n—Jeska, warrior adept', '"Fire is the universal language."\\n—Jhoira, master artificer', '"I followed her song only to find it was a dirge."\\n—Crovax', '"I need no army. I have Jamuraa."', '"If I must die, I will encounter darkness as a bride, / And hug it in mine arms."\\n—William Shakespeare,\\n*Measure for Measure*', '"If they can\'t take the hail, they\'d better stay home."\\n—Arna Kennerüd, skycaptain', '"If we cannot live proudly, we die so!"\\n—Eladamri, Lord of Leaves', '"In Rath," the priest said, "there is even greater need for prayer."', '"Isolation is not the answer."\\n—Urza, to Teferi', '"It offers you what you want, not what you need."\\n—Braids, dementia summoner', '"Never stop \'til you see your lance come out the other side."\\n—Telim\'Tor', '"No rest. No mercy. No matter what."', '"Of twenty yeer of age he was, I gesse.\\nOf his stature he was of evene lengthe.\\nAnd wonderly delyvere, and of greete strengthe."\\n—Geoffrey Chaucer,\\n*The Canterbury Tales*', '"Oi oi oi, me gotta hurt in \'ere,\\nOi oi oi, me smell a ting is near,\\nGonna bosh \'n gonna nosh \'n da\\nhurt\'ll disappear."\\n—Troll chant', '"Once, our people could call down the storm itself to do our bidding."\\n—Lovisa Coldeyes, Balduvian chieftain', '"Peace must prevail, even if the wicked must die."', '"Sir, I just thought . . . ," explained Vhati. "Don\'t think," interrupted Greven. "It doesn\'t suit you."', '"Slivers are evil and slivers are sly; And if you get eaten, then no one will cry."\\n—Mogg children\'s rhyme', '"Strength in numbers? Right."\\n—Ib Halfheart, goblin tactician', '"That phantom prow split the storm as lightning cast its long shadow on the battlefield below."\\n—Mireille Gaetane, *The Valeriad*', '"The cracks widened, the shell crumbled, and Valor spread throughout the land."\\n—*Scroll of Beginnings*', '"The efreet is a striding storm with a voice that crackles like fire."\\n—Qhattib, vizier of Amiqat', '"The fire of justice burns like nothing else."\\n—Lovisa Coldeyes, Balduvian chieftain', '"They have knives for every soul."\\n—Lyna, Soltari emissary', '"This is the forest primeval. The murmuring pines and the hemlocks . . . Stand like Druids of eld."\\n—Henry Wadsworth Longfellow, "Evangeline"', '"Us hungry, need food . . . . Lots of books . . . . Hmm . . . ."', '"You can build a perfect machine out of imperfect parts."\\n—Urza', 'A master of tactics, the Lord of Atlantis makes his people bold in battle merely by arriving to lead them.', 'Each Stormscape apprentice must hand-raise and train an owl before attaining the rank of master.', 'Feldon found the first of these canes frozen in the Ronom Glacier.', 'Harthag gave a jolly laugh as he surveyed the army before him. "Ho ho ho! Midgets! You think you can stand in my way?"', "Invented in Mishra's earlier days, the rack was once his most feared creation.", 'It has the strength of seven men. In fact, it used to be seven men.', 'It may wear your face, but its mind is its own.', 'It possesses no intelligence, only counter-intelligence.', "It's bigger than it thinks.", 'Its fangs are in your flesh before its hiss leaves your ears.', 'Members of the elite Moorish Cavalry are very particular about their mounts, choosing only those whose bloodlines have been pure for generations.', 'Occasionally, members of the Institute of Arcane Study acquire a taste for worldly pleasures. Seldom do they have trouble finding employment.', 'Once it consecrated the dead. Now it desecrates them.', 'Saffiyah clapped her hands and twenty flying men appeared at her side, each well trained in the art of combat.', 'Solitude drove the old hermit insane. Now he only keeps company with those he can catch.', 'Sometimes the wise ones wove their magic into living plants; as the plant grew, so grew the magic.', 'The auratog enjoys eating its wards.', 'The dark opening seemed to breathe the cold, damp air of the dead earth in a steady rhythm.', 'The highway of fear is the shortest route to defeat.', 'The slivers would survive, even at the expense of every other creature on Otaria.', 'The taskmaster knows that there is no cure for the common kobold.', 'The weight of death is heavy but not immovable.', "There are medicines for all afflictions but idleness.\\n—Suq'Ata saying", 'To keep the dead so others may live.\\n—Shadow Guild maxim', "When the Brotherhood of Gix dug out the cave of Koilos they found their master's severed hand. They enshrined it, hoping that one day it would point the way to Phyrexia."]
artist: ['Alan Pollack', 'Amy Weber', 'Anson Maddocks', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Ben Thompson', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Brom', 'Bryon Wackwitz', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Christopher Rush', 'Dameon Willich', 'Dan Frazier', 'Daniel Gelon', 'Daren Bader', 'David A. Cherry', 'Dennis Detwiller', 'Dermot Power', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Donato Giancola', 'Douglas Shuler', 'Drew Tucker', 'Edward P. Beard, Jr.', 'Eric Peterson', 'Gary Ruddell', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Spalenka', 'Harold McNeill', 'Heather Hudson', 'Henry G. Higginbotham', 'Janet Aulisio', 'Jeff A. Menges', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeff Laubenstein', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jesper Myrfors', 'John Howe', 'John Matson', 'Julie Baroh', 'Kev Walker', 'Liz Danforth', 'Margaret Organ-Kean', 'Mark Tedin', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Melissa A. Benson', 'Mike Kimble', 'Nicola Leonard', 'NéNé Thomas & Phillip Mosness', 'Pete Venters', 'Phil Foglio', 'Quinton Hoover', 'Randy Asplund-Faith', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Kane Ferguson', 'Richard Thomas', 'Rick Farrell', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spears', 'Ron Spencer', 'Scott Kirschner', 'Stuart Griffin', 'Susan Van Camp', 'Tim Hildebrandt', 'Tom Wänerstrand', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'rk post']
