\'26be04f0-331f-4a0f-b8c9-f64e067affb1\', \'multiverseId\': 131245}, \'multiverseid\': 131245}, {\'name\': \'Vhati il-Dal\', \'text\': \'{T}: La forza o la costituzione della creatura bersaglio diventa 1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Signore, stavo pensando che. . . ," spiegò Vhati. "Non pensare," lo interruppe Greven. "Non ti si addice."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49039c61-316f-4be1-9006-cf40ace19af3\', \'multiverseId\': 131487}, \'multiverseid\': 131487}, {\'name\': \'ヴァティ・イル＝ダル\', \'text\': \'{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。そのパワーかタフネスは、ターン終了時まで１になる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「あの、私はただ……その、考えたんですが … … 」とヴァティは説明しようとした。 「考えるな」とグレヴェンはさえぎった。 「お前には似合わないことだからな」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d60867-ad89-44cc-a8e7-db6241bb8078\', \'multiverseId\': 131608}, \'multiverseid\': 131608}, {\'name\': \'Vhati il-Dal\', \'text\': \'{T}: O poder ou a resistência da criatura alvo torna-se 1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Guerreiro Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Senhor, eu só pensei. . . ," explicou Vhati. "Não pense", interrompeu Greven. "Isso não combina com você."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94310388-d01a-4a4c-af50-ba2b0800a9b7\', \'multiverseId\': 131729}, \'multiverseid\': 131729}, {\'name\': \'Вати иль-Даль\', \'text\': \'{T}: Сила или защита целевого существа становится равной 1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — - Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Сэр, я думал. . .» объяснял Вати. «Не думай, прервал его Гревен. Это тебе не идет».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c7dd72-12b0-4a8b-b3ea-906937943412\', \'multiverseId\': 131850}, \'multiverseid\': 131850}, {\'name\': \'达奥黜人瓦提\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标生物的力量或是防御力成为1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「长官，我只是想. . . ，」瓦提解释着。 「别想了，」格利文打断了他的话。 「那不适合你。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'369bc24b-0371-4d99-8eb2-46bfac79825b\', \'multiverseId\': 131124}, \'multiverseid\': 131124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vorbote des Feuers\', \'text\': \'Schutz vor Weiß\\n{1}{R}: Der Vorbote des Feuers erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ifrit\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Ifrit ist ein umherziehender Sturm mit einer Stimme, die wie Feuer knistert." —Qhattib, Wesir von Amiqat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131373&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a649c01f-c6b2-41cc-a9e3-b62a9fcbb9aa\', \'multiverseId\': 131373}, \'multiverseid\': 131373}, {\'name\': \'Emisario del Dominio ígneo\', \'text\': \'Protección contra blanco.\\n{1}{R}: El Emisario del Dominio ígneo obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Efrit\', \'flavor\': \'"El efrit es una tormenta desatada, con una voz crepitante como el fuego." —Qhattib, visir de Amiqat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252cc9a1-05bd-4b47-95da-db76508b28d8\', \'multiverseId\': 131978}, \'multiverseid\': 131978}, {\'name\': \'Émissaire de Grégefeu\', \'text\': "Protection contre le blanc\\n{1}{R} : L\'Émissaire de Grégefeu gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : éfrit\', \'flavor\': "« L\'éfrit est une tornade en marche, avec une voix qui crache comme le feu. » —Qhattib, vizir d\'Amikat", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131252&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2ec2d1-54b3-40e2-a077-7e764d168157\', \'multiverseId\': 131252}, \'multiverseid\': 131252}, {\'name\': \'Emissario della Fiamma\', \'text\': "Protezione dal bianco\\n{1}{R}: L\'Emissario della Fiamma prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Efreet\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'Efreet è una tempesta impetuosa con una voce scoppiettante come il fuoco." —Qhattib, Visir di Amiqat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2259d7c8-2878-4de3-83f5-3846178dd148\', \'multiverseId\': 131494}, \'multiverseid\': 131494}, {\'name\': \'ワイルドファイアの密使\', \'text\': \'プロテクション（白）\\n{1}{R}：ワイルドファイアの密使は、ターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イフリート\', \'flavor\': \'イフリートとは、荒々しい嵐が烈火の声を得たようなものだ。 ――アミーカットの大臣、クハッティーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670afcb7-6105-488b-8b43-d6234a76f5be\', \'multiverseId\': 131615}, \'multiverseid\': 131615}, {\'name\': \'Emissário do Domínio Ígneo\', \'text\': \'Proteção contra o branco\\n{1}{R}: Emissário do Domínio Ígneo recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Efrite\', \'flavor\': \'"O efrite é uma tempestade cavalgante com uma voz que estala como fogo". —Qhattib, vizir de Amiqat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1faa75d1-7569-42c7-af2a-c35e7d5e3c30\', \'multiverseId\': 131736}, \'multiverseid\': 131736}, {\'name\': \'Посланник Дикого Огня\', \'text\': \'Защита от белого {1}{R}: Посланник Дикого Огня получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — - Эфрит\', \'flavor\': \'«Ифриты — шагающая гроза с огненным голосом», Хаттиб, визирь Амиквата\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b01a99e-973e-4c4b-b589-e524737d32aa\', \'multiverseId\': 131857}, \'multiverseid\': 131857}, {\'name\': \'野火密使\', \'text\': \'反白保护\\n{1}{R}：野火密使得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～魔神\', \'flavor\': \'「这魔神行如暴风肆虐，声似火焰爆裂。」 ～阿米卡大臣卡提布\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43445c68-a409-41d0-8036-051f8dee999d\', \'multiverseId\': 131131}, \'multiverseid\': 131131}]', "[{'name': 'Wiederauferstehung', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131331&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99b81f28-5190-48fc-b5e1-c34d951552cc', 'multiverseId': 131331}, 'multiverseid': 131331}, {'name': 'Resurrección', 'text': 'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al juego.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131936&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08084ed4-3f6c-47ee-ae9f-9782867790ee', 'multiverseId': 131936}, 'multiverseid': 131936}, {'name': 'Résurrection', 'text': 'Renvoyez en jeu la carte de créature ciblée de votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131210&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '885f37a1-5b4a-436d-885e-b416d0a792ff', 'multiverseId': 131210}, 'multiverseid': 131210}, {'name': 'Resurrezione', 'text': 'Rimetti in gioco una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131452&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdd71c10-671c-48a8-8fe4-d7e6bf0756b4', 'multiverseId': 131452}, 'multiverseid': 131452}, {'name': '復活', 'text': 'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを場に出す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131573&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18465fbb-39f4-48c8-bd8e-5c2a523e7bb3', 'multiverseId': 131573}, 'multiverseid': 131573}, {'name': 'Ressurreição', 'text': 'Devolva o card alvo de criatura de seu cemitério para o jogo.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131694&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3b94653-bfb1-4442-85c8-80bed5b6d444', 'multiverseId': 131694}, 'multiverseid': 131694}, {'name': 'Воскрешение', 'text': 'Верните целевую карту существа с вашего кладбища в игру.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131815&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99b5bd0e-b1d2-4d89-ac3b-66cc72d74938', 'multiverseId': 131815}, 'multiverseid': 131815}, {'name': '复活', 'text': '将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回场上。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131089&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd659e35-f011-4b62-bbb2-9f7681c98084', 'multiverseId': 131089}, 'multiverseid': 131089}]", "[{'name': 'Wirbelnder Derwisch', 'text': 'Schutz vor Schwarz\\nLege am Ende des Zuges, falls der Wirbelnde Derwisch einem Gegner in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt hat, eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131371&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef6e42c4-9888-47a9-b2aa-9ec1544109b8', 'multiverseId': 131371}, 'multiverseid': 131371}, {'name': 'Hostigadores derviches', 'text': 'Protección contra negro.\\nAl final del turno, si los Hostigadores derviches hicieron daño a un oponente este turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ellos.', 'type': 'Criatura — Monje humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131976&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53682855-420e-4c81-a8d1-aceac14e6e23', 'multiverseId': 131976}, 'multiverseid': 131976}, {'name': 'Derviche tourneur', 'text': 'Protection contre le noir\\nÀ la fin du tour, si le Derviche tourneur a infligé des blessures à un adversaire ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et moine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131250&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1dec1dde-186c-444d-8e33-7fb89e115927', 'multiverseId': 131250}, 'multiverseid': 131250}, {'name': 'Derviscio Turbinante', 'text': 'Protezione dal nero\\nAlla fine del turno, se il Derviscio Turbinante ha inflitto danno a un avversario in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Derviscio Turbinante.', 'type': 'Creatura — Monaco Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131492&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed78a245-dc62-4fd1-8cc5-f40af8664a3b', 'multiverseId': 131492}, 'multiverseid': 131492}, {'name': '疾風のデルヴィッシュ', 'text': 'プロテクション（黒）\\nターン終了時に、疾風のデルヴィッシュが、このターンいずれかの対戦相手にダメージを与えている場合、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131613&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35efe723-d204-467a-9808-e0407e830691', 'multiverseId': 131613}, 'multiverseid': 131613}, {'name': 'Mevlevi', 'text': 'Proteção contra o preto\\nNo final do turno, se Mevlevi tiver causado dano a um oponente neste turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre ele.', 'type': 'Criatura — Monge Humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131734&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2636ea8c-8d61-4177-8c5a-9858f0cf63c5', 'multiverseId': 131734}, 'multiverseid': 131734}, {'name': 'Вихревый Дервиш', 'text': 'Защита от черного\\nВ конце хода, если Вихревый Дервиш нанес повреждения противнику на этом ходу, положите на него жетон +1/+1.', 'type': 'Существо — - Человек Монах', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131855&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42103707-84d4-44ee-9171-c5eacc0e00ec', 'multiverseId': 131855}, 'multiverseid': 131855}, {'name': '苦修士', 'text': '反黑保护\\n在回合结束时，若苦修士本回合曾向对手造成伤害，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～人类／修行僧', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131129&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d0ab738-3f96-47ad-a6c4-6689d19d4e09', 'multiverseId': 131129}, 'multiverseid': 131129}]", "[{'name': 'Wolpertinger', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Wolpertinger eine Kreatur blockt, die keine Mauer ist, oder von ihr geblockt wird, zerstöre diese Kreatur am Ende des Kampfes.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Wolpertinger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131270&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebeafc25-f1a2-4711-8fe7-5cf84603522a', 'multiverseId': 131270}, 'multiverseid': 131270}, {'name': 'Cocatriz', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Cocatriz bloquee o sea bloqueada por una criatura que no sea Muro, destruye esa criatura al final del combate.', 'type': 'Criatura — Cocatriz', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131875&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7020d7d4-6599-4114-99df-6fcfd3787de7', 'multiverseId': 131875}, 'multiverseid': 131875}, {'name': 'Cocatrix', 'text': 'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Cocatrix bloque ou devient bloqué par une créature non-mur, détruisez cette créature à la fin du combat.', 'type': 'Créature : cocatrix', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131149&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66c169ce-358c-4fd1-b176-87007793cab5', 'multiverseId': 131149}, 'multiverseid': 131149}, {'name': 'Coccatrice', 'text': 'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Coccatrice blocca o viene bloccata da una creatura non Muro, distruggi quella creatura alla fine del combattimento.', 'type': 'Creatura — Coccatrice', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131391&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9b557cd-35b8-46e0-ba62-bbf996abd4f7', 'multiverseId': 131391}, 'multiverseid': 131391}, {'name': 'コカトリス', 'text': '飛行\\nコカトリスがいずれかの壁でないクリーチャーをブロックするかブロックされた状態になるたび、戦闘終了時にそのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — コカトリス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131512&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac33e95d-221d-43b0-b9f4-634c599a4466', 'multiverseId': 131512}, 'multiverseid': 131512}, {'name': 'Cocatriz', 'text': 'Voar\\nToda vez que Cocatriz bloquear ou for bloqueada por uma criatura que não seja Barreira, destrua aquela criatura no final do combate.', 'type': 'Criatura — Cocatriz', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131633&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a04b477-3a73-4b81-974f-a3f7460f394d', 'multiverseId': 131633}, 'multiverseid': 131633}, {'name': 'Василиск', 'text': 'Полет\\nКогда Василиск блокирует или заблокирован существом не-Стеной, уничтожьте это существо в конце боя.', 'type': 'Существо — - Василиск', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131754&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebf230fb-b6c9-41a6-b401-1a63b30c2115', 'multiverseId': 131754}, 'multiverseid': 131754}, {'name': '石化鸡蛇', 'text': '飞行\\n每当石化鸡蛇阻挡任何非墙生物，或被任何非墙生物阻挡，在战斗结束时消灭该生物。', 'type': '生物～石化鸡蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131028&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cca45344-b625-4c61-b54d-c774f9ff5f89', 'multiverseId': 131028}, 'multiverseid': 131028}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wurzelmauer\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nLege eine -0/-1-Marke auf die Wurzelmauer: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}. Spiele diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'Eines Tages verwoben die Weisen ihre Magie mit den Pflanzen und als die Pflanzen wuchsen, wuchs auch die Magie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60822a63-7001-428e-bdf3-bb279047a8c0\', \'multiverseId\': 131369}, \'multiverseid\': 131369}, {\'name\': \'Muro de raíces\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nPoner un contador -0/-1 sobre el Muro de raíces: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná. Juega esta habilidad sólo una vez cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Muro Planta\', \'flavor\': \'A veces los sabios urdían su magia con plantas vivas; según crecía la planta, también crecía la magia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f19a1755-96b9-4234-b589-e34259da9639\', \'multiverseId\': 131974}, \'multiverseid\': 131974}, {\'name\': \'Mur de racines\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\nMettez un marqueur -0/-1 sur le Mur de racines : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve. Ne jouez cette capacité qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : plante et mur\', \'flavor\': \'Parfois, les sages projettent leur magie dans les plantes vivaces ; et quand la plante grandit, sa magie grandit également.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131248&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2626f0fc-8a0e-4035-b7c6-c1944bf5869e\', \'multiverseId\': 131248}, \'multiverseid\': 131248}, {\'name\': \'Muro di Radici\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nMetti un segnalino -0/-1 sul Muro di Radici: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana. Gioca questa abilità solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Muro Pianta\', \'flavor\': \'Talvolta i saggi infondono i loro incanti nelle piante viventi; e mentre queste crescono, così cresce in possanza la magia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'322b525b-e1c2-415d-800f-53687655bcf6\', \'multiverseId\': 131490}, \'multiverseid\': 131490}, {\'name\': \'根の壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n根の壁の上に－０/－１カウンターを１個置く：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。 この能力は、毎ターン１回のみプレイできる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・壁\', \'flavor\': \'賢き者はときとして、生命ある植物に魔法を織り込む。植物が育つとともに、魔法も力を増すように。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38674e91-149c-423d-abfe-fa5cf6813fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 131611}, \'multiverseid\': 131611}, {\'name\': \'Barreira de Raízes\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\nColoque um marcador -0/-1 sobre Barreira de Raízes: Adicione {G} à sua reserva de mana. Use esta habilidade apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Barreira Planta\', \'flavor\': \'Às vezes, os sábios urdiam sua mágica em plantas vivas; conforme a planta crescia, também crescia a magia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dfa3147-1dbb-41c9-9308-2ffac97866c4\', \'multiverseId\': 131732}, \'multiverseid\': 131732}, {\'name\': \'Стена Корней\', \'text\': \'Защитник\\nПоложите жетон -0/-1 на Стену Корней: Добавьте {G} в ваше хранилище маны. Играйте эту способность только один раз за ход.\', \'type\': \'Существо — - Растение Стена\', \'flavor\': \'Иногда мудрецы вплетали свою магию в живые растения; по мере их роста росла и магия.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92570326-0fb4-44c4-9939-c9c0da236649\', \'multiverseId\': 131853}, \'multiverseid\': 131853}, {\'name\': \'根墙\', \'text\': \'守军\\n在根墙上放置一个-0/-1指示物：加{G}到你的法术力池中。 此异能每回合中只能使用一次。\', \'type\': \'生物～植物／墙\', \'flavor\': \'智者有时会将法术织入活的植物中；随着植物成长，法术也跟着壮大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7afe0024-97e0-406c-9f6c-4eddf1ce92e6\', \'multiverseId\': 131127}, \'multiverseid\': 131127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{T}: Die Wüste fügt einer angreifenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Spiele diese Fähigkeit nur während des Ende-des-Kampfes-Segments.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131278&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cbe864b-4bfa-42e7-a6a6-fa9f8e4b7c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 131278}, \'multiverseid\': 131278}, {\'name\': \'Desierto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}: El Desierto hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura atacante objetivo. Juega esta habilidad sólo durante el paso de final del combate.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38598433-4ec6-4359-85bd-1bead030776f\', \'multiverseId\': 131883}, \'multiverseid\': 131883}, {\'name\': \'Désert\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{T} : Le Désert inflige 1 blessure à la créature attaquante ciblée. Ne jouez cette capacité que pendant l\'étape de fin de combat.", \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131157&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e907fab-3503-4f05-b069-9dfe120a2b64\', \'multiverseId\': 131157}, \'multiverseid\': 131157}, {\'name\': \'Deserto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}: Il Deserto infligge 1 danno a una creatura attaccante bersaglio. Gioca questa abilità solo nella sottofase di fine combattimento.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e13b96c8-2c7e-47fa-bc74-4ddc2e6f9f48\', \'multiverseId\': 131399}, \'multiverseid\': 131399}, {\'name\': \'砂漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{T}：攻撃しているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。砂漠はそれに１点のダメージを与える。 この能力は戦闘終了ステップにのみプレイできる。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f01254c3-c730-4f8b-8872-7600178fe554\', \'multiverseId\': 131520}, \'multiverseid\': 131520}, {\'name\': \'Deserto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{T}: Deserto causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo atacante. Use esta habilidade somente durante a etapa de final de combate.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Deserto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d1b8d15-33fd-474a-950f-1b856f13c7c3\', \'multiverseId\': 131641}, \'multiverseid\': 131641}, {\'name\': \'Пустыня\', \'text\': \'{T}: Добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{T}: Пустыня наносит 1 повреждение целевому атакующему существу. Играйте эту способность только во время шага конца боя.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Пустыня\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6407d8b4-46d2-4ff8-99ea-d3ce3d0bdc67\', \'multiverseId\': 131762}, \'multiverseid\': 131762}, {\'name\': \'沙漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}：沙漠对目标进行攻击的生物造成1点伤害。 你只可以于战斗结束步骤中使用此异能。\', \'type\': \'地～沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b72fd959-f6bf-4fa5-bbee-b79e4aa4a2a8\', \'multiverseId\': 131036}, \'multiverseid\': 131036}]', "[{'name': 'Zersetzung', 'text': 'Zersetzung fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu. Diese Kreatur kann in diesem Zug nicht regeneriert werden. Falls die Kreatur in diesem Zug auf den Friedhof gelegt würde, entferne sie stattdessen ganz aus dem Spiel.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131281&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ad5fab0-ce32-4ec9-9500-3013b78c364c', 'multiverseId': 131281}, 'multiverseid': 131281}, {'name': 'Desintegrar', 'text': 'Desintegrar hace X puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo. Esa criatura no puede ser regenerada este turno. Si la criatura fuera a ir a un cementerio este turno, en vez de eso, remuévela del juego.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131886&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '362fb562-b5b6-4eaf-944b-bd28f977a3b4', 'multiverseId': 131886}, 'multiverseid': 131886}, {'name': 'Désintégration', 'text': 'La Désintégration inflige X blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur. Cette créature ne peut pas être régénérée ce tour-ci. Si cette créature devait être mise dans un cimetière ce tour-ci, retirez-la de la partie à la place.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131160&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33108c52-658c-4abf-8764-77f8512eb8e1', 'multiverseId': 131160}, 'multiverseid': 131160}, {'name': 'Disintegrazione', 'text': 'La Disintegrazione infligge X danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio. Quella creatura non può essere rigenerata in questo turno. Se la creatura sta per essere messa in un cimitero in questo turno, rimuovila invece dal gioco.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131402&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3120c494-a89a-4ec7-8110-6e08e5335b11', 'multiverseId': 131402}, 'multiverseid': 131402}, {'name': '分解', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。分解はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。 このターン、そのクリーチャーは再生できない。 そのクリーチャーがこのターンいずれかの墓地に置かれる場合、代わりにそれをゲームから取り除く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131523&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c66e24d-6550-42a1-aaa2-123b4ec15846', 'multiverseId': 131523}, 'multiverseid': 131523}, {'name': 'Desintegrar', 'text': 'Desintegrar causa X pontos de dano à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo. Aquela criatura não pode ser regenerada neste turno. Se a criatura seria colocada num cemitério neste turno, em vez disso, remova-a de jogo.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131644&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '585ec4d8-22ee-402d-93bf-cc72bc3f9282', 'multiverseId': 131644}, 'multiverseid': 131644}, {'name': 'Дезинтегрировать', 'text': 'Дезинтегрировать наносит Х повреждений целевому существу или игроку. Это существо не может быть регенерировано на этом ходу. Если это существо будет положено на кладбище на этом ходу, вместо этого удалите его из игры.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131765&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '001e43e8-3921-4a45-8dd4-29c21238191d', 'multiverseId': 131765}, 'multiverseid': 131765}, {'name': '分解', 'text': '分解对目标生物或牌手造成X点伤害。 该生物于本回合中不能重生。 若该生物于本回合中将被置入坟墓场，则改为将它移出对战。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131039&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63585980-acd4-47e6-8a91-f88c6ac87438', 'multiverseId': 131039}, 'multiverseid': 131039}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zhalfirinischer Kommandant\', \'text\': \'Flankenangriff (Immer wenn eine Kreatur ohne Flankenangriff diese Kreatur blockt, erhält die blockende Kreatur -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\n{1}{W}{W}: Ein Ritter deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Kommandieren ist wie ein Hochseilakt, bei dem man seine Gefolgsleute überzeugt, sie hätten festen Boden unter ihren Füßen." —General Jabari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131377&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7f0b4b-d80e-4331-a2b7-7000e49eaeb6\', \'multiverseId\': 131377}, \'multiverseid\': 131377}, {\'name\': \'Comandante zhalfirino\', \'text\': \'Flanquea. (Siempre que una criatura sin la habilidad de flanquear bloquee a esta criatura, la criatura bloqueadora obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.)\\n{1}{W}{W}: El Caballero objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mandar es el arte de balancearse en una enredadera y convencer a otros de que es terreno firme." —Sidar Jabari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3947579c-04db-458c-8b34-1806e000f50d\', \'multiverseId\': 131982}, \'multiverseid\': 131982}, {\'name\': \'Commandant zhalfirín\', \'text\': "Débordement (À chaque fois qu\'une créature sans le débordement bloque cette créature, la créature bloqueuse gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\n{1}{W}{W} : Le chevalier ciblé gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Commander, c\'est l\'acte de tenir en équilibre sur un fil et de convaincre les autres que c\'est un large pont. » —Sidar Djabari", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131256&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'493c9d16-f4c5-44b9-a20c-6d05032bdbe6\', \'multiverseId\': 131256}, \'multiverseid\': 131256}, {\'name\': \'Comandante di Zhalfir\', \'text\': \'Aggirare (Ogniqualvolta una creatura senza aggirare blocca questa creatura, la creatura bloccante prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.)\\n{1}{W}{W}: Un Cavaliere bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il comando è l\\\'arte di stare in equilibrio su un fuscello e convincere gli altri che hai i piedi ben saldi a terra." —Sidar Jabari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b66a5cd0-1dee-4377-9962-523df574139c\', \'multiverseId\': 131498}, \'multiverseid\': 131498}, {\'name\': \'ザルファーの指揮官\', \'text\': \'側面攻撃 （側面攻撃を持たないいずれかのクリーチャーがこのクリーチャーをブロックするたび、ブロックしているクリーチャーはターン終了時まで－１/－１の修整を受ける。）\\n{1}{W}{W}：騎士１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'指揮とは、一本のつるの上を渡りながら、他の者たちには確かな大地を進んでいるのだと思いこませる技である。 ――シダー・ジャバーリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a11c71c4-6b28-4d26-b84f-fd64cca22d86\', \'multiverseId\': 131619}, \'multiverseid\': 131619}, {\'name\': \'Comandante Zhalfiriano\', \'text\': \'Flanquear (Toda vez que uma criatura sem flanquear bloquear esta criatura, a criatura bloqueadora receberá -1/-1 até o final do turno.)\\n{1}{W}{W}: O Cavaleiro alvo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cavaleiro Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Comandar é o ato de equilibrar-se em uma videira e convencer a todos que é terra firme." —Sidar Jabari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'963a3ecb-0381-4669-98ce-d1a85c7fa7f1\', \'multiverseId\': 131740}, \'multiverseid\': 131740}, {\'name\': \'Командир Жалфиринов\', \'text\': \'Обход (Когда существо без обхода блокирует это существо, тогда это блокирующее существо получает -1/-1 до конца хода.)\\n{1}{W}{W}: Целевой Рыцарь получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — - Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Командование это как балансировать на хрупкой ветке, убеждая всех, что под ногами твердая земля», Сидар Джабари\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ddfdac-9498-44fd-9066-ead1edd604d6\', \'multiverseId\': 131861}, \'multiverseid\': 131861}, {\'name\': \'赛费尔指挥官\', \'text\': \'侧面攻击（每当一个不具侧面攻击之生物阻挡此生物时，该阻挡生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。）\\n{1}{W}{W}：目标骑士得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「指挥这回事，就如同在藤蔓上面保持平衡，还要令人觉得你脚底踏的是坚实土地。」 ～西达将军贾巴力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67a38b7b-1ddb-4b4f-ad68-be2392d619c8\', \'multiverseId\': 131135}, \'multiverseid\': 131135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zwölffüßler\', \'text\': \'Falls ein Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit, der bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, dazu führt, dass du den Zwölffüßler aus deiner Hand abwirfst, bringe ihn mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, anstatt ihn auf deinen Friedhof zu legen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5827eefd-a58c-46f9-86ac-085947d6b8f3\', \'multiverseId\': 131282}, \'multiverseid\': 131282}, {\'name\': \'Dodecapodo\', \'text\': \'Si un hechizo o habilidad que controle un oponente te obliga a descartar el Dodecapodo, ponlo en juego con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él en vez de ponerlo en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c4e267a-2354-417c-9b0f-eba9a16a0db1\', \'multiverseId\': 131887}, \'multiverseid\': 131887}, {\'name\': \'Dodécapode\', \'text\': "Si un sort ou une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous contraint à vous défausser du Dodécapode, mettez-le en jeu avec, sur lui, deux marqueurs +1/+1 au lieu de le mettre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5c7bfdf-6df5-4e17-8794-5f2ea95651ac\', \'multiverseId\': 131161}, \'multiverseid\': 131161}, {\'name\': \'Dodecapode\', \'text\': "Se una magia o un\'abilità controllata da un avversario ti fa scartare il Dodecapode, mettilo in gioco con due segnalini +1/+1 su di esso invece di metterlo nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13e99772-7950-4cc5-a36e-7da1a4b43f8e\', \'multiverseId\': 131403}, \'multiverseid\': 131403}, {\'name\': \'十二足獣\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力によって、あなたが十二足獣を捨てさせられる場合、それをあなたの墓地に置く代わりに、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置いた状態で場に出す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21c56d7e-fec9-407d-ae4c-d160c35c039e\', \'multiverseId\': 131524}, \'multiverseid\': 131524}, {\'name\': \'Dodecápode\', \'text\': \'Se uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla fizer com que você descarte o Dodecápode, em vez de colocá-lo no cemitério, coloque-o em jogo com dois marcadores +1/+1 sobre ele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2413ea15-1f6a-4353-93b9-a01fa76367cf\', \'multiverseId\': 131645}, \'multiverseid\': 131645}, {\'name\': \'Додекапод\', \'text\': \'Если заклинание или способность, контролируемая вашим оппонентом, приведет к тому, что вы скинете Додекапода, то вместо того, чтобы положить его на кладбище, положите его в игру с двумя +1/+1 жетонами на нем..\', \'type\': \'Артефактное Существо — - Голем\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94139d71-c6af-4d6e-a580-bcb9c1842602\', \'multiverseId\': 131766}, \'multiverseid\': 131766}, {\'name\': \'打肢怪\', \'text\': \'如果由对手所操控的咒语或异能使得你弃掉打肢怪，则改为将它放置进场且上面有两个+1/+1指示物，而非置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=131040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'889b4b81-6688-4c84-8e3d-2d670a6a4c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 131040}, \'multiverseid\': 131040}]']
printings: ['2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', 'A25', 'AFC', 'ALL', 'APC', 'ARC', 'ARN', 'ATH', 'ATQ', 'BCHR', 'BRB', 'BRO', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C17', 'C19', 'C20', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHR', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CNS', 'CST', 'DD2', 'DDC', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDG', 'DDK', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DRB', 'DRK', 'DVD', 'EMA', 'EXO', 'F02', 'F03', 'F04', 'F08', 'F09', 'F16', 'FBB', 'FEM', 'FNM', 'G05', 'GVL', 'H09', 'HA5', 'HA7', 'HML', 'HOP', 'ICE', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ITP', 'J17', 'J18', 'J21', 'JUD', 'JVC', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LEG', 'LGN', 'M10', 'M13', 'M15', 'M20', 'M21', 'ME2', 'ME3', 'ME4', 'MGB', 'MIR', 'MKC', 'MM2', 'MM3', 'MMA', 'MMQ', 'MOC', 'MP2', 'NCC', 'NEM', 'ODY', 'OLEP', 'ONS', 'OTC', 'P03', 'P07', 'P30A', 'P30H', 'PAL00', 'PAL01', 'PAL02', 'PARL', 'PCY', 'PD2', 'PD3', 'PDCI', 'PGPX', 'PHPR', 'PJAS', 'PJJT', 'PJSE', 'PLS', 'PLST', 'PMDA', 'PMEI', 'PPRO', 'PRM', 'PS11', 'PSCG', 'PSUS', 'PTC', 'PW24', 'REN', 'RIN', 'RQS', 'SCD', 'SCG', 'SIR', 'SLD', 'SOI', 'SPG', 'STH', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TMP', 'TOR', 'TPR', 'TSB', 'UDS', 'ULG', 'UMA', 'USG', 'V10', 'V12', 'V15', 'VIS', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WTH', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['Any player may have Browbeat deal 5 damage to him or her. If no one does, target player draws three cards.', "As Conspiracy comes into play, choose a creature type.\\nCreature cards you own that aren't in play, creature spells you control, and creatures you control are the chosen type.", "As Teferi's Moat comes into play, choose a color.\\nCreatures of the chosen color without flying can't attack you.", "As The Rack comes into play, choose an opponent.\\nAt the beginning of the chosen player's upkeep, The Rack deals X damage to that player, where X is 3 minus the number of cards in his or her hand.", 'Assault deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a spore counter on Thallid.\\nRemove three spore counters from Thallid: Put a 1/1 green Saproling creature token into play.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Krosan Cloudscraper unless you pay {G}{G}.\\nMorph {7}{G}{G} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Sacred Mesa unless you sacrifice a Pegasus.\\n{1}{W}: Put a 1/1 white Pegasus creature token with flying into play.', 'Black creatures get +1/+1.', 'Buyback {5} (You may pay an additional {5} as you play this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nDraw a card.', 'Choose a number. Destroy all artifacts and creatures with converted mana cost equal to that number. Then target player reveals his or her hand and discards all nonland cards with converted mana cost equal to the number.', 'Choose one Target player discards a card; or target creature gets +2/-1 until end of turn; or target creature gains swampwalk until end of turn.', 'Counter target instant or Aura spell that targets a permanent you control.', "Dandân can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.\\nWhen you control no Islands, sacrifice Dandân.", 'Defender\\nPut a -0/-1 counter on Wall of Roots: Add {G} to your mana pool. Play this ability only once each turn.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Disintegrate deals X damage to target creature or player. That creature can't be regenerated this turn. If the creature would be put into a graveyard this turn, remove it from the game instead.", 'Echo {2}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhenever Hunting Moa comes into play or is put into a graveyard from play, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Enchant creature you control\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to target creature or player."\\nSacrifice Fire Whip: Fire Whip deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, put a -1/-1 counter on that creature.", "Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is indestructible and can't be enchanted by other Auras.", 'Fear\\nWhenever Shadowmage Infiltrator deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.', 'Fiery Justice deals 5 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players. Target opponent gains 5 life.', 'Fiery Temper deals 3 damage to target creature or player.\\nMadness {R} (If you discard this card, you may play it for its madness cost instead of putting it into your graveyard.)', 'First strike\\nAs long as Valor is in your graveyard and you control a Plains, creatures you control have first strike.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\n{1}{W}{W}: Target Knight gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flash (You may play this spell any time you could play an instant.)\\nWhen Mystic Snake comes into play, counter target spell.', 'Flying', 'Flying, first strike, vigilance, trample, haste, protection from black, protection from red', 'Flying, vigilance, haste', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Nicol Bolas unless you pay {U}{B}{R}.\\nWhenever Nicol Bolas deals damage to an opponent, that player discards his or her hand.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Cockatrice blocks or becomes blocked by a non-Wall creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', "Flying\\nWhenever Swamp Mosquito attacks and isn't blocked, defending player gets a poison counter. (A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game.)", 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Soul Collector this turn is put into a graveyard, return that card to play under your control.\\nMorph {B}{B}{B} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Flying\\nWhite spells and black spells you play cost {1} less to play.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Dragon Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn. At end of turn, if this ability has been played four or more times this turn, sacrifice Dragon Whelp.', 'Flying\\n{U}{U}{U}: Regenerate Ghost Ship.', "Gaea's Liege's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Forests you control. As long as Gaea's Liege is attacking, its power and toughness are each equal to the number of Forests defending player controls instead.\\n{T}: Target land becomes a Forest until Gaea's Liege leaves play.", 'Gemstone Mine comes into play with three mining counters on it.\\n{T}, Remove a mining counter from Gemstone Mine: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. If there are no mining counters on Gemstone Mine, sacrifice it.', 'Hail Storm deals 2 damage to each attacking creature and 1 damage to you and each creature you control.', 'Haste\\nEcho {3}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Avalanche Riders comes into play, destroy target land.', 'Haste\\nFlanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)', 'Haste\\n{R}{R}{R}: Regenerate Eron the Relentless.', 'Icatian Javelineers comes into play with a javelin counter on it.\\n{T}, Remove a javelin counter from Icatian Javelineers: Icatian Javelineers deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Dodecapod, put it into play with two +1/+1 counters on it instead of putting it into your graveyard.', "If there are ten or more creature cards total in all graveyards, Avatar of Woe costs {6} less to play.\\nFear\\n{T}: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Kicker {R} and/or {W}\\nWhen Thornscape Battlemage comes into play, if the {R} kicker cost was paid, it deals 2 damage to target creature or player.\\nWhen Thornscape Battlemage comes into play, if the {W} kicker cost was paid, destroy target artifact.', 'Kicker {W}{W} (You may pay an additional {W}{W} as you play this spell.)\\nWhen Desolation Giant comes into play, destroy all other creatures you control. If the kicker cost was paid, destroy all other creatures instead.', 'Kicker {X} (You may pay an additional {X} as you play this spell.)\\nAll other Treefolk and all Saprolings get +1/+1.\\nWhen Verdeloth the Ancient comes into play, if the kicker cost was paid, put X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens into play.', "Lands you control are Plains.\\nNonland cards you own that aren't in play, spells you control, and nonland permanents you control are white.\\nYou may spend white mana as though it were mana of any color. You may spend other mana only as though it were colorless mana.", "Merieke Ri Berit doesn't untap during your untap step.\\n{T}: Gain control of target creature as long as you control Merieke Ri Berit. When Merieke Ri Berit leaves play or becomes untapped, destroy that creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Mindless Automaton comes into play with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}, Discard a card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Mindless Automaton.\\nRemove two +1/+1 counters from Mindless Automaton: Draw a card.', "Mistform Ultimus is every creature type (even if this card isn't in play).", 'Morph {1}{U} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Willbender is turned face up, change the target of target spell or ability with a single target.', "Non-Eye creatures you control can't attack.\\nEvil Eye of Orms-by-Gore can't be blocked except by Walls.", 'Other Kobolds you control get +1/+0.', 'Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk.', "Pirate Ship can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.\\n{T}: Pirate Ship deals 1 damage to target creature or player.\\nWhen you control no Islands, sacrifice Pirate Ship.", "Play with your hand revealed.\\nIf you would draw a card, reveal the top card of your library instead. If it's a creature card, put it into your graveyard. Otherwise, draw a card.\\nWhenever a creature is put into your graveyard from play, return it to your hand.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Uncle Istvan by creatures.', 'Protection from black\\nAt end of turn, if Whirling Dervish dealt damage to an opponent this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Protection from black\\nThreshold Mystic Enforcer gets +3/+3 and has flying as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.', 'Protection from red\\nShadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Protection from white\\n{1}{R}: Wildfire Emissary gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Psionic Blast deals 4 damage to target creature or player and 2 damage to you.', 'Put a 3/3 green Elephant creature token into play.\\nFlashback {3}{G} (You may play this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then remove it from the game.)', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to play.', 'Sacrifice an enchantment: Auratog gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Scragnoth can't be countered.\\nProtection from blue", 'Search your library for a Dragon card and put it into play. Then shuffle your library.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn.)', 'Serrated Arrows comes into play with three arrowhead counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if there are no arrowhead counters on Serrated Arrows, sacrifice it.\\n{T}, Remove an arrowhead counter from Serrated Arrows: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\nDauthi Slayer attacks each turn if able.', 'Spike Feeder comes into play with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: You gain 2 life.', 'Swampwalk\\nWhenever a player plays a black spell, you gain 1 life.', 'Target opponent discards a card at random, then discards a card.', "Target player shuffles up to three target cards from his or her graveyard into his or her library.\\nDraw a card.\\nWhen Gaea's Blessing is put into your graveyard from your library, shuffle your graveyard into your library.", "The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to target creature or player this turn, prevent that damage. If damage from a red source is prevented this way, Honorable Passage deals damage equal to the damage prevented this way to the source's controller.", 'Trample', "Trample\\nLeviathan comes into play tapped and doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice two Islands. If you do, untap Leviathan.\\nLeviathan can't attack unless you sacrifice two Islands.", "Trample\\nOrgg can't attack if defending player controls an untapped creature with power 3 or greater.\\nOrgg can't block creatures with power 3 or greater.", 'Trample\\nRampage 2 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn for each creature blocking it beyond the first.)', 'Tribal Flames deals X damage to target creature or player, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'When Defiant Vanguard blocks, at end of combat, destroy it and all creatures it blocked this turn.\\n{5}, {T}: Search your library for a Rebel card with converted mana cost 4 or less and put it into play. Then shuffle your library.', "When Faceless Butcher comes into play, remove target creature other than Faceless Butcher from the game.\\nWhen Faceless Butcher leaves play, return the removed card to play under its owner's control.", "When Ovinomancer comes into play, sacrifice it unless you return three basic lands you control to their owner's hand.\\n{T}, Return Ovinomancer to its owner's hand: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated. That creature's controller puts a 0/1 green Sheep creature token into play.", 'When Sengir Autocrat comes into play, put three 0/1 black Serf creature tokens into play.\\nWhen Sengir Autocrat leaves play, remove all Serf tokens from the game.', "Whenever Goblin Snowman blocks, prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by it this turn.\\n{T}: Goblin Snowman deals 1 damage to target creature it's blocking.", 'Whenever Spitting Slug blocks or becomes blocked, you may pay {1}{G}. If you do, Spitting Slug gains first strike until end of turn. Otherwise, each creature blocking or blocked by Spitting Slug gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Whenever a Sliver becomes blocked, that Sliver gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'Whenever a Sliver deals damage, its controller gains that much life.', "Whenever a creature comes into play, that creature's controller may have it deal damage equal to its power to target creature or player of his or her choice.", 'Whenever you play an instant or sorcery spell, you may pay {3}. If you do, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', "You may choose not to untap Giant Oyster during your untap step.\\n{T}: As long as Giant Oyster remains tapped, target tapped creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step, and at the beginning of each of your draw steps, put a -1/-1 counter on that creature. When Giant Oyster leaves play or becomes untapped, remove all -1/-1 counters from the creature.", 'You win the game if you control a land of each basic land type and a creature of each color.', 'Zombie spells you play cost {1} less to play.\\nZombies you control get +2/+1.', '{1}, Sacrifice a permanent: You gain 1 life.', '{1}: Remove target card in a graveyard from the game.', '{2}, Discard a card at random: Stormbind deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Grinning Totem: Search target opponent's library for a card and remove it from the game. Then that player shuffles his or her library. Until the beginning of your next upkeep, you may play that card. At the beginning of your next upkeep, if you haven't played it, put it into its owner's graveyard.", "{2}, {T}: Remove target creature you control from the game.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice Safe Haven. If you do, return each card removed from the game with Safe Haven to play under its owner's control.", '{2}{G}, {T}, Discard two cards: Until end of turn, all lands target player controls are 3/3 creatures that are still lands.', "{3}, {T}: Tap target creature you control and target creature of an opponent's choice he or she controls. Each of those creatures deals damage equal to its power to the other.", "{3}: Target creature gains islandwalk until end of turn. When War Barge leaves play this turn, destroy that creature. A creature destroyed this way can't be regenerated.", '{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', '{R}, {T}: Look at the top eight cards of your library. Remove four of them at random from the game, then put the rest on top of your library in any order.', '{R}: Regenerate Uthden Troll.', "{T}, Remove Feldon's Cane from the game: Shuffle your graveyard into your library.", "{T}, Sacrifice Tormod's Crypt: Remove target player's graveyard from the game.", '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Desert deals 1 damage to target attacking creature. Play this ability only during the end of combat step.', '{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Target 1/1 creature gets +1/+2 until end of turn.', '{T}: Destroy target creature with islandwalk.', "{T}: Draw a card and reveal it. If it isn't a land card, discard it.", '{T}: Prodigal Sorcerer deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', "{T}: Target creature's power or toughness becomes 1 until end of turn.", "{T}: Witch Hunter deals 1 damage to target player.\\n{1}{W}{W}, {T}: Return target creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand.", "{U}, {T}: Put target creature you control on top of its owner's library.\\n{R}, {T}: Shadow Guildmage deals 1 damage to target creature or player and 1 damage to you.", '{U}{U}, Sacrifice a Wizard: Counter target spell.\\nMorph {U} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)']
